
# 🎨 UI/UX Patterns - BibleAppPOCV2

## 🎯 **Core Principle: Clean Text First, Formatting Second**

**NEW APPROACH**: Character encoding corruption issues have been resolved at the **root cause** through clean Core ML model export. Apply typography and formatting **after** you have clean text, not as a workaround for corrupted text.

**OLD APPROACH (DEPRECATED)**: Complex text sanitization and formatting layers that tried to fix corrupted text.

